  "internal_thinking": "Bob is offering 1 Wheat for 1 Brick. Looking at my resources, I have 2 Wheat, 1 Brick, and 1 Sheep. My primary goal is to settle Node 7 (Brick Port), which requires 1 Wood, 1 Brick, 1 Wheat, and 1 Sheep. If I give away my only Brick, I lose the ability to settle even if I get the Wood I need. Furthermore, I already have Wheat production on 8 and 9 (Nodes 14 and 41), so I don't desperately need more Wheat. Bob is brick-starved and needs it to build roads and expand. Giving him the Brick helps him more than the Wheat helps me, especially since I'm holding the only Brick I have for my own settlement. I should reject this.",
