  "note_to_self": "Rejected Bob's Wheat-for-Brick trade. I need to keep my 1 Brick for the Node 7 settlement. I have plenty of Wheat production (Nodes 14 and 41). Still need 1 Wood to settle Node 7.",
  "say_outloud": "I'd love to help you out, Bob, but that's my only brick and I'm planning to use it very soon. If you had some wood or maybe another sheep, we might be able to talk."
